{"id":"d9fee219bda40fd9","group":"FormalSystem","path":"FormalSystem/182_有序域理论_OF.md","title":"182 有序域理论 OF","display":"182_有序域理论_OF","type":"system","metadata":{},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[],"html":"<p><span class=\"inline-tag\">#FormalSystem</span></p>\n<h1 id=\"182.-有序域理论-OF\">182. 有序域理论 OF</h1>\n<h1 id=\"1.-原始语言\">1. 原始语言</h1>\n<p>变量集为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Var}=\\{x_i:i\\in\\mathbb N\\}\">\\(\\mathsf{Var}=\\{x_i:i\\in\\mathbb N\\}\\)</span>。对有限 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\\subseteq\\mathsf{Var}\">\\(X\\subseteq\\mathsf{Var}\\)</span> 定义 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{fresh}(X)=x_m\">\\(\\operatorname{fresh}(X)=x_m\\)</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"m=\\min\\{i:x_i\\notin X\\}\">\\(m=\\min\\{i:x_i\\notin X\\}\\)</span>。</p>\n<p>项构造符为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"0,1,+,-,\\times,\\operatorname{inv}\">\\(0,1,+,-,\\times,\\operatorname{inv}\\)</span>。公式构造符为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"=,\\le,\\bot,\\land,\\lor,\\to,\\forall\">\\(=,\\le,\\bot,\\land,\\lor,\\to,\\forall\\)</span>。目标差异是只加入有序域公理，不加入平方根闭包或奇次多项式根公理。</p>\n<h1 id=\"2.-项与公式闭包\">2. 项与公式闭包</h1>\n<p>定义 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Term}_{OF}\">\\(\\mathsf{Term}_{OF}\\)</span> 为满足下列闭包条件的最小集合：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"0,1\\in\\mathsf{Term}_{OF}\">\\(0,1\\in\\mathsf{Term}_{OF}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\\in\\mathsf{Var}\">\\(x\\in\\mathsf{Var}\\)</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\\in\\mathsf{Term}_{OF}\">\\(x\\in\\mathsf{Term}_{OF}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s,t\\in\\mathsf{Term}_{OF}\">\\(s,t\\in\\mathsf{Term}_{OF}\\)</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s+t\\in\\mathsf{Term}_{OF}\">\\(s+t\\in\\mathsf{Term}_{OF}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"t\\in\\mathsf{Term}_{OF}\">\\(t\\in\\mathsf{Term}_{OF}\\)</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"-t\\in\\mathsf{Term}_{OF}\">\\(-t\\in\\mathsf{Term}_{OF}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s,t\\in\\mathsf{Term}_{OF}\">\\(s,t\\in\\mathsf{Term}_{OF}\\)</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s\\times t\\in\\mathsf{Term}_{OF}\">\\(s\\times t\\in\\mathsf{Term}_{OF}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"t\\in\\mathsf{Term}_{OF}\">\\(t\\in\\mathsf{Term}_{OF}\\)</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{inv}(t)\\in\\mathsf{Term}_{OF}\">\\(\\operatorname{inv}(t)\\in\\mathsf{Term}_{OF}\\)</span>。</li>\n</ol>\n<p>定义 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Frm}_{OF}\">\\(\\mathsf{Frm}_{OF}\\)</span> 为满足下列闭包条件的最小集合：</p>\n<ol>\n<li>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s,t\\in\\mathsf{Term}_{OF}\">\\(s,t\\in\\mathsf{Term}_{OF}\\)</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s=t\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{OF}\">\\(s=t\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{OF}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s,t\\in\\mathsf{Term}_{OF}\">\\(s,t\\in\\mathsf{Term}_{OF}\\)</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s\\le t\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{OF}\">\\(s\\le t\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{OF}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\bot\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{OF}\">\\(\\bot\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{OF}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{OF}\">\\(A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{OF}\\)</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\land B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{OF}\">\\(A\\land B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{OF}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{OF}\">\\(A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{OF}\\)</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\lor B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{OF}\">\\(A\\lor B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{OF}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{OF}\">\\(A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{OF}\\)</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\to B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{OF}\">\\(A\\to B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{OF}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\\in\\mathsf{Var}\">\\(x\\in\\mathsf{Var}\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{OF}\">\\(A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{OF}\\)</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\forall xA\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{OF}\">\\(\\forall xA\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{OF}\\)</span>。</li>\n</ol>\n<p>派生记号为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\neg A:=A\\to\\bot,\\quad\n\\exists xA:=\\neg\\forall x\\neg A,\\quad\nA\\leftrightarrow B:=(A\\to B)\\land(B\\to A),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\neg A:=A\\to\\bot,\\quad\n\\exists xA:=\\neg\\forall x\\neg A,\\quad\nA\\leftrightarrow B:=(A\\to B)\\land(B\\to A),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"x&lt;y:=(x\\le y)\\land\\neg(y\\le x),\\qquad\nx\\ne y:=\\neg(x=y).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[x&lt;y:=(x\\le y)\\land\\neg(y\\le x),\\qquad\nx\\ne y:=\\neg(x=y).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"3.-自由变量、绑定变量与替换\">3. 自由变量、绑定变量与替换</h1>\n<p>定义</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathsf T}:\\mathsf{Term}_{OF}\\to\\mathcal P(\\mathsf{Var})\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathsf T}:\\mathsf{Term}_{OF}\\to\\mathcal P(\\mathsf{Var})\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>如下：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathsf T}(0)=\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathsf T}(1)=\\varnothing,\\qquad\n\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathsf T}(x)=\\{x\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathsf T}(0)=\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathsf T}(1)=\\varnothing,\\qquad\n\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathsf T}(x)=\\{x\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathsf T}(s+t)=\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathsf T}(s)\\cup\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathsf T}(t),\n\\quad\n\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathsf T}(-t)=\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathsf T}(t),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathsf T}(s+t)=\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathsf T}(s)\\cup\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathsf T}(t),\n\\quad\n\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathsf T}(-t)=\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathsf T}(t),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathsf T}(s\\times t)=\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathsf T}(s)\\cup\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathsf T}(t),\n\\quad\n\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathsf T}(\\operatorname{inv}(t))=\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathsf T}(t).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathsf T}(s\\times t)=\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathsf T}(s)\\cup\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathsf T}(t),\n\\quad\n\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathsf T}(\\operatorname{inv}(t))=\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathsf T}(t).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>定义</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FV}:\\mathsf{Frm}_{OF}\\to\\mathcal P(\\mathsf{Var})\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{FV}:\\mathsf{Frm}_{OF}\\to\\mathcal P(\\mathsf{Var})\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>如下：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FV}(s=t)=\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathsf T}(s)\\cup\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathsf T}(t),\n\\quad\n\\operatorname{FV}(s\\le t)=\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathsf T}(s)\\cup\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathsf T}(t),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{FV}(s=t)=\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathsf T}(s)\\cup\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathsf T}(t),\n\\quad\n\\operatorname{FV}(s\\le t)=\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathsf T}(s)\\cup\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathsf T}(t),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FV}(\\bot)=\\varnothing,\\quad\n\\operatorname{FV}(A\\land B)=\\operatorname{FV}(A)\\cup\\operatorname{FV}(B),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{FV}(\\bot)=\\varnothing,\\quad\n\\operatorname{FV}(A\\land B)=\\operatorname{FV}(A)\\cup\\operatorname{FV}(B),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FV}(A\\lor B)=\\operatorname{FV}(A)\\cup\\operatorname{FV}(B),\n\\quad\n\\operatorname{FV}(A\\to B)=\\operatorname{FV}(A)\\cup\\operatorname{FV}(B),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{FV}(A\\lor B)=\\operatorname{FV}(A)\\cup\\operatorname{FV}(B),\n\\quad\n\\operatorname{FV}(A\\to B)=\\operatorname{FV}(A)\\cup\\operatorname{FV}(B),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FV}(\\forall xA)=\\operatorname{FV}(A)\\setminus\\{x\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{FV}(\\forall xA)=\\operatorname{FV}(A)\\setminus\\{x\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>定义</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{BV}:\\mathsf{Frm}_{OF}\\to\\mathcal P(\\mathsf{Var})\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{BV}:\\mathsf{Frm}_{OF}\\to\\mathcal P(\\mathsf{Var})\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>由</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{BV}(s=t)=\\operatorname{BV}(s\\le t)=\\operatorname{BV}(\\bot)=\\varnothing,\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{BV}(s=t)=\\operatorname{BV}(s\\le t)=\\operatorname{BV}(\\bot)=\\varnothing,\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{BV}(A\\circ B)=\\operatorname{BV}(A)\\cup\\operatorname{BV}(B)\n\\quad(\\circ\\in\\{\\land,\\lor,\\to\\}),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{BV}(A\\circ B)=\\operatorname{BV}(A)\\cup\\operatorname{BV}(B)\n\\quad(\\circ\\in\\{\\land,\\lor,\\to\\}),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{BV}(\\forall xA)=\\operatorname{BV}(A)\\cup\\{x\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{BV}(\\forall xA)=\\operatorname{BV}(A)\\cup\\{x\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>定义。</p>\n<p>定义 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Sub}_{\\mathsf T}:\\mathsf{Term}_{OF}\\times\\mathsf{Var}\\times\\mathsf{Term}_{OF}\\to\\mathsf{Term}_{OF}\">\\(\\operatorname{Sub}_{\\mathsf T}:\\mathsf{Term}_{OF}\\times\\mathsf{Var}\\times\\mathsf{Term}_{OF}\\to\\mathsf{Term}_{OF}\\)</span>，记 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"r[x:=t]\">\\(r[x:=t]\\)</span>，其子句为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"0[x:=t]=0,\\quad 1[x:=t]=1,\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[0[x:=t]=0,\\quad 1[x:=t]=1,\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"y[x:=t]=\n\\begin{cases}\nt,&amp;y=x,\\\\\ny,&amp;y\\ne x,\n\\end{cases}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[y[x:=t]=\n\\begin{cases}\nt,&amp;y=x,\\\\\ny,&amp;y\\ne x,\n\\end{cases}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"(s+u)[x:=t]=s[x:=t]+u[x:=t],\\quad\n(-s)[x:=t]=-(s[x:=t]),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[(s+u)[x:=t]=s[x:=t]+u[x:=t],\\quad\n(-s)[x:=t]=-(s[x:=t]),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"(s\\times u)[x:=t]=s[x:=t]\\times u[x:=t],\\quad\n\\operatorname{inv}(s)[x:=t]=\\operatorname{inv}(s[x:=t]).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[(s\\times u)[x:=t]=s[x:=t]\\times u[x:=t],\\quad\n\\operatorname{inv}(s)[x:=t]=\\operatorname{inv}(s[x:=t]).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>定义 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Sub}_{\\mathsf F}:\\mathsf{Frm}_{OF}\\times\\mathsf{Var}\\times\\mathsf{Term}_{OF}\\to\\mathsf{Frm}_{OF}\">\\(\\operatorname{Sub}_{\\mathsf F}:\\mathsf{Frm}_{OF}\\times\\mathsf{Var}\\times\\mathsf{Term}_{OF}\\to\\mathsf{Frm}_{OF}\\)</span>，记 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A[x:=t]\">\\(A[x:=t]\\)</span>，其原子和联结词子句为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"(s=u)[x:=t]=(s[x:=t]=u[x:=t]),\\quad\n(s\\le u)[x:=t]=(s[x:=t]\\le u[x:=t]),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[(s=u)[x:=t]=(s[x:=t]=u[x:=t]),\\quad\n(s\\le u)[x:=t]=(s[x:=t]\\le u[x:=t]),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\bot[x:=t]=\\bot,\\quad\n(A\\land B)[x:=t]=A[x:=t]\\land B[x:=t],\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\bot[x:=t]=\\bot,\\quad\n(A\\land B)[x:=t]=A[x:=t]\\land B[x:=t],\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"(A\\lor B)[x:=t]=A[x:=t]\\lor B[x:=t],\\quad\n(A\\to B)[x:=t]=A[x:=t]\\to B[x:=t].\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[(A\\lor B)[x:=t]=A[x:=t]\\lor B[x:=t],\\quad\n(A\\to B)[x:=t]=A[x:=t]\\to B[x:=t].\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A=\\forall yB\">\\(A=\\forall yB\\)</span>，则分三种情形。</p>\n<p>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"y=x\">\\(y=x\\)</span>，则</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"(\\forall yB)[x:=t]=\\forall yB.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[(\\forall yB)[x:=t]=\\forall yB.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"y\\ne x\">\\(y\\ne x\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"y\\notin\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathsf T}(t)\">\\(y\\notin\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathsf T}(t)\\)</span>，则</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"(\\forall yB)[x:=t]=\\forall y(B[x:=t]).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[(\\forall yB)[x:=t]=\\forall y(B[x:=t]).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"y\\ne x\">\\(y\\ne x\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"y\\in\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathsf T}(t)\">\\(y\\in\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathsf T}(t)\\)</span>，取</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"z=\\operatorname{fresh}(\\operatorname{FV}(B)\\cup\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathsf T}(t)\\cup\\{x,y\\})\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[z=\\operatorname{fresh}(\\operatorname{FV}(B)\\cup\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathsf T}(t)\\cup\\{x,y\\})\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>并令</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"(\\forall yB)[x:=t]=\\forall z\\bigl((B[y:=z])[x:=t]\\bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[(\\forall yB)[x:=t]=\\forall z\\bigl((B[y:=z])[x:=t]\\bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>定义</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FreeRen}(A,x,z)=A[x:=z],\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{FreeRen}(A,x,z)=A[x:=z],\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{BoundRen}(\\forall xA,x,z)=\\forall z(A[x:=z])\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{BoundRen}(\\forall xA,x,z)=\\forall z(A[x:=z])\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"z\\notin\\operatorname{FV}(A)\\setminus\\{x\\}\">\\(z\\notin\\operatorname{FV}(A)\\setminus\\{x\\}\\)</span> 时有定义。</p>\n<p>令 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal E_{OF}\">\\(\\mathcal E_{OF}\\)</span> 为所有满足下列条件的关系 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"E\\subseteq\\mathsf{Frm}_{OF}^2\">\\(E\\subseteq\\mathsf{Frm}_{OF}^2\\)</span>：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"E\">\\(E\\)</span> 是等价关系。</li>\n<li>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(A_0,B_0),(A_1,B_1)\\in E\">\\((A_0,B_0),(A_1,B_1)\\in E\\)</span>，则</li>\n</ol>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"(A_0\\circ A_1,B_0\\circ B_1)\\in E\n\\quad(\\circ\\in\\{\\land,\\lor,\\to\\}).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[(A_0\\circ A_1,B_0\\circ B_1)\\in E\n\\quad(\\circ\\in\\{\\land,\\lor,\\to\\}).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><ol start=\"3\">\n<li>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(A,B)\\in E\">\\((A,B)\\in E\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\\in\\mathsf{Var}\">\\(x\\in\\mathsf{Var}\\)</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(\\forall xA,\\forall xB)\\in E\">\\((\\forall xA,\\forall xB)\\in E\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"z\\notin\\operatorname{FV}(A)\\setminus\\{x\\}\">\\(z\\notin\\operatorname{FV}(A)\\setminus\\{x\\}\\)</span>，则</li>\n</ol>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"(\\forall xA,\\forall z(A[x:=z]))\\in E.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[(\\forall xA,\\forall z(A[x:=z]))\\in E.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>定义 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\equiv_\\alpha=\\bigcap\\mathcal E_{OF}\">\\(\\equiv_\\alpha=\\bigcap\\mathcal E_{OF}\\)</span>。</p>\n<h1 id=\"4.-逻辑公理\">4. 逻辑公理</h1>\n<p>定义</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\mathsf{Logic}}\n=\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\to,1}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\to,2}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\to,3}\n\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\forall,1}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\forall,2}\n\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{=,1}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{=,2}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\mathsf{Logic}}\n=\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\to,1}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\to,2}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\to,3}\n\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\forall,1}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\forall,2}\n\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{=,1}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{=,2}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>其中各族为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\to,1}=\\{A\\to(B\\to A):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{OF}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\to,1}=\\{A\\to(B\\to A):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{OF}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\to,2}=\\{(A\\to(B\\to C))\\to((A\\to B)\\to(A\\to C)):A,B,C\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{OF}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\to,2}=\\{(A\\to(B\\to C))\\to((A\\to B)\\to(A\\to C)):A,B,C\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{OF}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\to,3}=\\{((A\\to\\bot)\\to(B\\to\\bot))\\to(B\\to A):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{OF}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\to,3}=\\{((A\\to\\bot)\\to(B\\to\\bot))\\to(B\\to A):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{OF}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\forall,1}=\\{\\forall xA\\to A[x:=t]:x\\in\\mathsf{Var},A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{OF},t\\in\\mathsf{Term}_{OF}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\forall,1}=\\{\\forall xA\\to A[x:=t]:x\\in\\mathsf{Var},A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{OF},t\\in\\mathsf{Term}_{OF}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\forall,2}=\\{\\forall x(A\\to B)\\to(A\\to\\forall xB):x\\in\\mathsf{Var},A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{OF},x\\notin\\operatorname{FV}(A)\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\forall,2}=\\{\\forall x(A\\to B)\\to(A\\to\\forall xB):x\\in\\mathsf{Var},A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{OF},x\\notin\\operatorname{FV}(A)\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{=,1}=\\{t=t:t\\in\\mathsf{Term}_{OF}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{=,1}=\\{t=t:t\\in\\mathsf{Term}_{OF}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{=,2}=\\{s=t\\to(C[x:=s]\\leftrightarrow C[x:=t]):x\\in\\mathsf{Var},C\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{OF},s,t\\in\\mathsf{Term}_{OF}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{=,2}=\\{s=t\\to(C[x:=s]\\leftrightarrow C[x:=t]):x\\in\\mathsf{Var},C\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{OF},s,t\\in\\mathsf{Term}_{OF}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"5.-域公理与有序公理\">5. 域公理与有序公理</h1>\n<p>定义</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{OF}\n=\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\mathsf{Logic}}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\mathsf{Field}}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\mathsf{OFOrder}}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{OF}\n=\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\mathsf{Logic}}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\mathsf{Field}}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\mathsf{OFOrder}}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>其中</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\mathsf{AddGrp}}=\n\\{(x+y)+z=x+(y+z),\\ x+y=y+x,\\ x+0=x,\\ x+(-x)=0:\nx,y,z\\in\\mathsf{Term}_{OF}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\mathsf{AddGrp}}=\n\\{(x+y)+z=x+(y+z),\\ x+y=y+x,\\ x+0=x,\\ x+(-x)=0:\nx,y,z\\in\\mathsf{Term}_{OF}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\mathsf{MulMon}}=\n\\{(x\\times y)\\times z=x\\times(y\\times z),\\ x\\times y=y\\times x,\\ x\\times1=x,\\ x\\times(y+z)=x\\times y+x\\times z:\nx,y,z\\in\\mathsf{Term}_{OF}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\mathsf{MulMon}}=\n\\{(x\\times y)\\times z=x\\times(y\\times z),\\ x\\times y=y\\times x,\\ x\\times1=x,\\ x\\times(y+z)=x\\times y+x\\times z:\nx,y,z\\in\\mathsf{Term}_{OF}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\mathsf{Inv}}=\n\\{x\\ne0\\to x\\times\\operatorname{inv}(x)=1,\\ 0\\ne1:x\\in\\mathsf{Term}_{OF}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\mathsf{Inv}}=\n\\{x\\ne0\\to x\\times\\operatorname{inv}(x)=1,\\ 0\\ne1:x\\in\\mathsf{Term}_{OF}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\mathsf{Field}}\n=\n\\{(x+y)+z=x+(y+z),\\ x+y=y+x,\\ x+0=x,\\ x+(-x)=0:\nx,y,z\\in\\mathsf{Term}_{OF}\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\mathsf{Field}}\n=\n\\{(x+y)+z=x+(y+z),\\ x+y=y+x,\\ x+0=x,\\ x+(-x)=0:\nx,y,z\\in\\mathsf{Term}_{OF}\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\cup\n\\{(x\\times y)\\times z=x\\times(y\\times z),\\ x\\times y=y\\times x,\\ x\\times1=x,\\ x\\times(y+z)=x\\times y+x\\times z:\nx,y,z\\in\\mathsf{Term}_{OF}\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\cup\n\\{(x\\times y)\\times z=x\\times(y\\times z),\\ x\\times y=y\\times x,\\ x\\times1=x,\\ x\\times(y+z)=x\\times y+x\\times z:\nx,y,z\\in\\mathsf{Term}_{OF}\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\cup\n\\{x\\ne0\\to x\\times\\operatorname{inv}(x)=1,\\ 0\\ne1:x\\in\\mathsf{Term}_{OF}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\cup\n\\{x\\ne0\\to x\\times\\operatorname{inv}(x)=1,\\ 0\\ne1:x\\in\\mathsf{Term}_{OF}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\mathsf{OFOrder}}\n=\n\\{x\\le x,\\ (x\\le y\\land y\\le z)\\to x\\le z,\\ (x\\le y\\land y\\le x)\\to x=y,\\ x\\le y\\lor y\\le x:\nx,y,z\\in\\mathsf{Term}_{OF}\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\mathsf{OFOrder}}\n=\n\\{x\\le x,\\ (x\\le y\\land y\\le z)\\to x\\le z,\\ (x\\le y\\land y\\le x)\\to x=y,\\ x\\le y\\lor y\\le x:\nx,y,z\\in\\mathsf{Term}_{OF}\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\cup\n\\{x\\le y\\to x+z\\le y+z,\\ (0\\le x\\land0\\le y)\\to0\\le x\\times y:\nx,y,z\\in\\mathsf{Term}_{OF}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\cup\n\\{x\\le y\\to x+z\\le y+z,\\ (0\\le x\\land0\\le y)\\to0\\le x\\times y:\nx,y,z\\in\\mathsf{Term}_{OF}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>序相容公理族拆分为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\mathsf{OrderBase}}=\n\\{x\\le x,\\ (x\\le y\\land y\\le z)\\to x\\le z,\\ (x\\le y\\land y\\le x)\\to x=y,\\ x\\le y\\lor y\\le x:\nx,y,z\\in\\mathsf{Term}_{OF}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\mathsf{OrderBase}}=\n\\{x\\le x,\\ (x\\le y\\land y\\le z)\\to x\\le z,\\ (x\\le y\\land y\\le x)\\to x=y,\\ x\\le y\\lor y\\le x:\nx,y,z\\in\\mathsf{Term}_{OF}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\mathsf{OrderCompat}}=\n\\{x\\le y\\to x+z\\le y+z,\\ (0\\le x\\land0\\le y)\\to0\\le x\\times y:\nx,y,z\\in\\mathsf{Term}_{OF}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\mathsf{OrderCompat}}=\n\\{x\\le y\\to x+z\\le y+z,\\ (0\\le x\\land0\\le y)\\to0\\le x\\times y:\nx,y,z\\in\\mathsf{Term}_{OF}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"6.-规则关系\">6. 规则关系</h1>\n<p>定义</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\frac{A\\qquad A\\to B}{B},\n\\qquad\n\\frac{A}{\\forall xA},\n\\qquad\n\\frac{A}{B}\\ (A\\equiv_\\alpha B).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\frac{A\\qquad A\\to B}{B},\n\\qquad\n\\frac{A}{\\forall xA},\n\\qquad\n\\frac{A}{B}\\ (A\\equiv_\\alpha B).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\mathsf{MP}}=\\{((A,A\\to B),B):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{OF}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\mathsf{MP}}=\\{((A,A\\to B),B):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{OF}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\forall}=\\{((A),\\forall xA):A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{OF},x\\in\\mathsf{Var}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\forall}=\\{((A),\\forall xA):A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{OF},x\\in\\mathsf{Var}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\alpha}=\\{((A),B):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{OF},A\\equiv_\\alpha B\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\alpha}=\\{((A),B):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{OF},A\\equiv_\\alpha B\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"7.-证明对象\">7. 证明对象</h1>\n<p>令 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\\subseteq\\mathsf{Frm}_{OF}\">\\(\\Gamma\\subseteq\\mathsf{Frm}_{OF}\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Proof}_{OF}(\\Gamma,\\pi,A)\">\\(\\operatorname{Proof}_{OF}(\\Gamma,\\pi,A)\\)</span> 当且仅当 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\pi=(A_0,\\ldots,A_{n-1})\">\\(\\pi=(A_0,\\ldots,A_{n-1})\\)</span> 是非空有限序列，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A_{n-1}=A\">\\(A_{n-1}=A\\)</span>，且每个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A_j\">\\(A_j\\)</span> 满足下列条件之一：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A_j\\in\\Gamma\">\\(A_j\\in\\Gamma\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A_j\\in\\mathsf{Ax}_{OF}\">\\(A_j\\in\\mathsf{Ax}_{OF}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>存在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"r,s&lt;j\">\\(r,s&lt;j\\)</span> 使得 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A_s=A_r\\to A_j\">\\(A_s=A_r\\to A_j\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>存在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"r&lt;j,x\\in\\mathsf{Var}\">\\(r&lt;j,x\\in\\mathsf{Var}\\)</span> 使得 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A_j=\\forall xA_r\">\\(A_j=\\forall xA_r\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\\notin\\bigcup_{G\\in\\Gamma}\\operatorname{FV}(G)\">\\(x\\notin\\bigcup_{G\\in\\Gamma}\\operatorname{FV}(G)\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>存在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"r&lt;j\">\\(r&lt;j\\)</span> 使得 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A_r\\equiv_\\alpha A_j\">\\(A_r\\equiv_\\alpha A_j\\)</span>。</li>\n</ol>\n<h1 id=\"8.-可导性\">8. 可导性</h1>\n<p>定义</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\\vdash_{OF}A\n\\quad\\Longleftrightarrow\\quad\n\\exists\\pi\\,\\operatorname{Proof}_{OF}(\\Gamma,\\pi,A).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\Gamma\\vdash_{OF}A\n\\quad\\Longleftrightarrow\\quad\n\\exists\\pi\\,\\operatorname{Proof}_{OF}(\\Gamma,\\pi,A).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"9.-目标差异\">9. 目标差异</h1>\n<p>目标公理族为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\mathsf{OnlyOF}}\n=\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\mathsf{Field}}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\mathsf{OFOrder}}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\mathsf{OnlyOF}}\n=\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\mathsf{Field}}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\mathsf{OFOrder}}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>它只给出域与全序相容公理；最终公理集不含平方根闭包或奇次多项式根族，这一排除形式化地区分 OF 与 EOF、RCF。</p>\n<h1 id=\"10.-形式系统\">10. 形式系统</h1>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal S_{OF}=(\\mathsf{Var},\\operatorname{fresh},\\mathsf{Term}_{OF},\\mathsf{Frm}_{OF},\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathsf T},\\operatorname{FV},\\operatorname{BV},\\operatorname{Sub}_{\\mathsf T},\\operatorname{Sub}_{\\mathsf F},\\operatorname{FreeRen},\\operatorname{BoundRen},\\equiv_\\alpha,\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\mathsf{AddGrp}},\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\mathsf{MulMon}},\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\mathsf{Inv}},\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\mathsf{OrderBase}},\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\mathsf{OrderCompat}},\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\mathsf{OnlyOF}},\\mathsf{Ax}_{OF},\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\mathsf{MP}},\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\forall},\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\alpha},\\operatorname{Proof}_{OF},\\vdash_{OF}).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathcal S_{OF}=(\\mathsf{Var},\\operatorname{fresh},\\mathsf{Term}_{OF},\\mathsf{Frm}_{OF},\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathsf T},\\operatorname{FV},\\operatorname{BV},\\operatorname{Sub}_{\\mathsf T},\\operatorname{Sub}_{\\mathsf F},\\operatorname{FreeRen},\\operatorname{BoundRen},\\equiv_\\alpha,\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\mathsf{AddGrp}},\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\mathsf{MulMon}},\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\mathsf{Inv}},\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\mathsf{OrderBase}},\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\mathsf{OrderCompat}},\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\mathsf{OnlyOF}},\\mathsf{Ax}_{OF},\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\mathsf{MP}},\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\forall},\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\alpha},\\operatorname{Proof}_{OF},\\vdash_{OF}).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>该系统只给出有序域一阶证明系统；不加入语义载体、赋值、满足关系、有效性、语义后承、平方根闭包、奇次多项式根公理、完备性公理、模型论结果或外部语义解释。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"182.-有序域理论-OF","text":"182. 有序域理论 OF","level":1},{"id":"1.-原始语言","text":"1. 原始语言","level":1},{"id":"2.-项与公式闭包","text":"2. 项与公式闭包","level":1},{"id":"3.-自由变量、绑定变量与替换","text":"3. 自由变量、绑定变量与替换","level":1},{"id":"4.-逻辑公理","text":"4. 逻辑公理","level":1},{"id":"5.-域公理与有序公理","text":"5. 域公理与有序公理","level":1},{"id":"6.-规则关系","text":"6. 规则关系","level":1},{"id":"7.-证明对象","text":"7. 证明对象","level":1},{"id":"8.-可导性","text":"8. 可导性","level":1},{"id":"9.-目标差异","text":"9. 目标差异","level":1},{"id":"10.-形式系统","text":"10. 形式系统","level":1}],"links":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathsf{Var}=\\{x_i:i\\in\\mathbb N\\}","display":false},{"tex":"X\\subseteq\\mathsf{Var}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{fresh}(X)=x_m","display":false},{"tex":"m=\\min\\{i:x_i\\notin X\\}","display":false},{"tex":"0,1,+,-,\\times,\\operatorname{inv}","display":false},{"tex":"=,\\le,\\bot,\\land,\\lor,\\to,\\forall","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf{Term}_{OF}","display":false},{"tex":"0,1\\in\\mathsf{Term}_{OF}","display":false},{"tex":"x\\in\\mathsf{Var}","display":fal